{"slug":"user-management-api","title":"User Management API","desc":"","og":"https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Nexus-API-hero.png","content":"<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/hero {\"label\":\"User Management API\",\"title\":\"API for HR Systems\",\"intro\":\"Automate lone worker service administration\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"demo-dialog\",\"variant\":\"\"},{\"linkText\":\"Get a Quote\",\"link\":\"/uk/get-your-quote/\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"outline\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Nexus-API-hero.png@@\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/trustpilot-widget {\"widget\":\"horizontal\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"preTitle\":\"Streamline operations\",\"title\":\"Increase team productivity\",\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/smartmockups_lvkvwf6f-1024x683.jpg@@\",\"framed\":false} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Eliminate manual data entry and management of users with our <a href=\"/uk/nexus/\">Nexus</a> API for user management systems such as WorkDay, Oracle HR and PeopleHR. This integration reduces errors and enables:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Reduced data entry</strong> – all joiners, leavers and team structures are updated automatically from central HR system.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Cost savings</strong> – reduced administrative overheads and more time for strategic work due to seamless data exchange</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Scalability</strong> – your internal systems are mirrored by Nexus to accommodate growth or organisational changes without disruption.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Future-proof flexibility</strong> – continued integration with new tools and technologies via open API architecture.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Automate team management updates\",\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/smartmockups_lvkvpiz3-1024x411.png@@\",\"framed\":false,\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The User Management API includes the ability to automate tasks, such as:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Managing user profiles</strong> – adding new hires, assigning app subscriptions and archiving leavers</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Managing team structure</strong> – adding/removing user profiles and managers to relevant teams</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Managing groups</strong> – adding/removing teams and managers to relevant groups</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">See how to implement this</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Download Brochure\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Download Product Brochure\",\"link\":\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/product-brochure/page/12/4/?teaser=yes\",\"linkTarget\":true,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"outline\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/product-brochure-turtl.jpg@@\",\"framed\":false} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Want to learn more about how the User Management API can increase the data accuracy and minimise the administration work of your lone worker service?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Download our comprehensive product brochure for detailed information on its features and benefits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Discover how the User Management API provides more time for proactive risk management and strategic thinking.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/product-brochure/page/12/4/?teaser=yes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download Product Brochure</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/cta-banner {\"theme\":\"orange\",\"title\":\"See how it works\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eTo get a User Management API and Nexus demo, contact our experts using the form below:\\u003c/p\\u003e\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/form {\"formUrl\":\"https://safe.peoplesafe.co.uk/l/830213/2024-03-05/2hl7qq\",\"height\":550} /-->","menu_order":14,"types":["api","features"]}